WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
(lively music)

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.950
- Everyone needs a little pick-me-up.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.440
A pat on the back or the old high five.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.460
And here's a little dose
of, "You can do it," energy

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.340
from someone we love.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:16.170
- I believe it all starts
with you and I in the mirror.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.940
I don't know how to make
collective change out there.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.700
I don't know what the policy is

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.123
to help the world get along better.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.440
But I do truly believe

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.740
that if each one of us look in the mirror

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:28.573
and say, "You know what?

00:00:28.573 --> 00:00:29.950
I'm gonna be a little bit better today.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.710
I'm gonna be a little bit more fair today.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.470
I'm gonna take a little bit
more responsibility today

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.430
to therefore get to my freedom tomorrow."

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.150
If enough of us do that,

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.130
that's how we make a collective change.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.280
That's the soldiers that
I think we can all be,

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.283
going forward, so we can
have a little evolution.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.610
Have fun doing it, too.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:52.720
Break a sweat.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.913
- Now that was inspiring.

